  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Resources</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Resources</p>\n        <h1>Everything you need before you hit publish.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Templates, checklists and guides written by the editors who review releases every day. No email gate on any of it.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a release</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"glossary.html\">Browse the glossary</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  The PressCosmos resource library contains press release templates for eight announcement types, pre-submission checklists, guides on writing, SEO PR and AI visibility, a glossary of more than 40 industry terms, and planning tools such as a distribution tier selector and a crisis statement builder.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Templates</p>\n      <h2>Press release templates</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Copy the structure, replace the specifics. Each template includes the headings an editor expects and the elements that most often go missing.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    <a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Funding announcement</h3><p>Structure for a raise, with the disclosure items investors and reporters expect.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Product launch</h3><p>Lead with what changed and for whom, plus the substantiation an editor will ask for.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"investor-relations.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Earnings release</h3><p>Result framing, comparison basis and the analyst-facing elements.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Appointment or hire</h3><p>Executive announcements without the boilerplate biography padding.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"distribution.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Partnership or contract win</h3><p>Disclosable terms, customer naming and the numbers that make it material.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"crisis-communications.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Crisis holding statement</h3><p>Six pre-approved statement shapes, ready to adapt under pressure.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"ai-visibility.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Research or report launch</h3><p>Methodology, sample size and the finding stated plainly in the first line.</p>\n    </a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"entertainment.html\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Event or award</h3><p>What to include so a listings desk can act on it without emailing you.</p>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Checklists</p>\n      <h2>Pre-submission checklists</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-2\">\n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.6rem\">\n      <h3>Release quality</h3>\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Headline states the news and fits under 100 characters</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Dateline present with city and date</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>First paragraph answers who, what, when, where, why</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>At least one specific, verifiable number</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Quote from a named person with a real title</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Boilerplate current and factual</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Media contact monitored during working hours</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.6rem\">\n      <h3>Search and AI readiness</h3>\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Answer block of 40–60 words near the top</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Organisation named consistently on every mention</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Subheadings phrased as real questions</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Image assets with descriptive alt text</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Canonical URL on the hosted release page</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>No hidden text, cloaking or prompt injection</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Guides</p>\n      <h2>In-depth guides</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-grid\">\n    \n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a0-0\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"225\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#7c5cff\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#a0-0)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" opacity=\".85\"><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"112\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"52\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"112\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"52\" transform=\"rotate(48 200 112)\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"112\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"52\" transform=\"rotate(96 200 112)\"/></g><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"112\" r=\"34\" fill=\"url(#a0-0)\" opacity=\".9\"/></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\">How to write a press release that gets picked up</a></h3>\n    <p>The structure, the openings that get rejected, and the checklist.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"press-release-seo-guide.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a1-7\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"0\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f472b6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#7c5cff\"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke=\"url(#a1-7)\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".9\"><path d=\"M0 170c40-70 70 30 110-20s60-80 100-40 80 90 190 20\"/><path d=\"M0 195c50-50 80 20 120-30s70-60 110-20 70 70 170 10\" opacity=\".5\"/></g><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"60\" r=\"20\" fill=\"url(#a1-7)\" opacity=\".85\"/></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"press-release-seo-guide.html\">Press release SEO: the complete guide</a></h3>\n    <p>Keyword mapping, on-page structure and backlink realities.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"press-release-seo-guide.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"aeo-geo-llmo-explained.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a2-14\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"225\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#a3e635\"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke=\"url(#a2-14)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".8\"><path d=\"M40 185V95M100 185V45M160 185v-70M220 185V70M280 185v-52M340 185v-96\"/></g><g fill=\"url(#a2-14)\" opacity=\".95\"><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"95\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"115\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"70\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"133\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"89\" r=\"7\"/></g></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"aeo-geo-llmo-explained.html\">AEO, GEO and LLMO explained</a></h3>\n    <p>What each discipline requires from a comms team.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"aeo-geo-llmo-explained.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"press-release-pricing-guide.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><radialGradient id=\"a3-21\" cx=\".5\" cy=\".5\" r=\".5\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fbbf24\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fb7185\"/></radialGradient></defs><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#a3-21)\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" opacity=\".9\"><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"112\" r=\"70\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"112\" r=\"70\"/><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"112\" r=\"110\" opacity=\".45\"/></g><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"112\" r=\"28\" fill=\"url(#a3-21)\"/></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"press-release-pricing-guide.html\">What distribution should cost in 2026</a></h3>\n    <p>Price bands, cost drivers and how to spot a padded network.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"press-release-pricing-guide.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"ai-search-pr-2026.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a4-28\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"225\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#7c5cff\"/><stop offset=\".5\" stop-color=\"#f472b6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\"url(#a4-28)\" opacity=\".9\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" opacity=\".55\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"60\" width=\"170\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" opacity=\".8\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"12\" opacity=\".7\"/></g></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"ai-search-pr-2026.html\">How AI search changed PR</a></h3>\n    <p>Fewer clicks, more summarised answers, and what to measure now.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"ai-search-pr-2026.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"compare.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a5-35\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"225\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#a3e635\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke=\"url(#a5-35)\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" opacity=\".85\"><path d=\"M30 190 90 60l60 90 60-110 60 100 70-80\"/></g><g fill=\"url(#a5-35)\"><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"60\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"60\" r=\"6\"/></g></svg></a>\n  <div class=\"story-body\">\n    <p class=\"story-meta\"><span>Guide</span><span>·</span><time datetime=\"2026-10-30\">Updated 2026-10-30</time></p>\n    <h3><a href=\"compare.html\">Compare distribution platforms</a></h3>\n    <p>PressCosmos against five alternatives, including where we lose.</p>\n    <div class=\"story-foot\"><span>Reference</span><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"compare.html\">Read <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Tools</p>\n      <h2>Planning tools</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Distribution tier selector</h3>\n  <p>Answer four questions about your announcement and get a recommended tier ladder.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Crisis statement builder</h3>\n  <p>Assemble a holding statement from approved language in minutes.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"crisis-communications.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>AI visibility audit</h3>\n  <p>We run your tracked question set across nine engines and send you the raw answers.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"ai-visibility.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Use the resources, then test one release.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">The guides are free and ungated. If they help, the fastest way to check our work is one $149 distribution.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.8
}
